      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `069fa3a2742d09d26ff26d4c4622aa37e1b92465da936419bdcc26bbd8e963e4--prisoners-australia-2017-cube-1-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Prisoners in Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2017\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 15 of 15\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 0aaed2eb8f3d66d4df5c38f48f2bda94a07becc488798baecb7a22423b954031 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 2e3bceb8bf7b26f788c8e511d1f3870000f5e0a87bee6462ef8ab3c9eb4915cf | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 376f164b563e2fc5d6f40d33d13a5460748f52145492314cb36b16e9a50723cc | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 7d5563de6dfb4c281921bf1e2d1a82a71bb1425f10e310d47884576f098cc53c | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | ea5c63ae310860ce21b3520984dc6d0216429c7d5c5792876bc557446b34c46a | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | e485c1da9efc871da24908bca8460902e61984384a5d986f0d35cef5983f8f6d | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 1af88fa46cb0b3a88449d74e1b6af34e9437e1fde242206c1ffa4aa7e48f823c | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 6234d21e65fbb77045f7307e7c33b9c983e2dc79cd361be05bcc23d8762b4f6c | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 6359ed7db0b417f56e7096f8b4532e2af554545439b3917d085c90a36bc7118b | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | 0ba4c0e43f34baeea4b2880750fe87d402e3a013ec1aea78e30d391215268e35 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | 19e947729e5d3c0c1e0f38565d4eaf15f7ce579ece630581f0e634dcb60af72d | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | 35391d4f93c55954efa3dbd4dd9d3790d968bac0d99f6fe257be4944074c6812 | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | f5f02c4e36027d3b47c27c35e548a45e26616eb7735fcdc289ff938e5f7e9984 | missing |\n| \"Table_13\" | 4c52f167d2c5538bd69d54cdb1093f3eab487dd07c94a2a0ac9fb872c4425a48 | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | 4d3bc4927f5c24e8d1a0d51860326c77100702a57522bf7d38cd13fc2fe82f89 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
